graph TD
    Start([ER Trauma Patient Influx]) --> CheckQR{Does Patient Have PRANA QR?}
    
    CheckQR -- Yes --> ScanQR[ER Staff Scans QR via Hospital Desk Scanner]
    ScanQR --> QueryAPI[POST /api/emergency/hospital-access with Staff JWT]
    QueryAPI --> LogAudit[Insert into emergency_access_logs]
    LogAudit --> RenderDossier[Display Immediate Trauma Dossier: Blood Group & Allergies]
    
    CheckQR -- No --> SearchPID[Search by Phone Number / National ID / Name]
    SearchPID --> VerifyConsent{Emergency Override or Patient OTP?}
    VerifyConsent -- OTP Verified --> GrantAccess[Display Comprehensive Longitudinal EHR]
    VerifyConsent -- Trauma Override --> LogOverride[Log Critical Emergency Override Reason]
    LogOverride --> GrantAccess
    
    RenderDossier --> TriageAction[Doctor Initiates Resuscitation / Transfusion]
    GrantAccess --> UpdateEHR[Hospital Doctor Enters Clinical Encounter Notes]
    UpdateEHR --> SyncDB[POST /api/hospital/encounters - Write to Database]
    SyncDB --> End([Patient Stabilized & Admitted])
